ui-hello-from-tessera = Hello from Tessera!

ui-tessera-tagline = A cross-platform UI library focused on performance and extensibility.

ui-this-is-a-sample-application-for-the-tessera-ui-framework-tessera-is-a-modern-ui-framework = This sample application showcases Tessera's capabilities and some of its components.

    Tessera is a modern UI framework written in Rust. It aims to provide high performance, ease of use, and cross-platform support.

    Open the navigation menu to explore Material components, glass effects, and a custom shader.
